        "raw": "<p>Does anyone have the interest and/or ability to create SotM-specific emoji? Things like these...&nbsp;</p><ul><li>Legacy (and/or Setback?) with a thumbs-up like ![](upload://2nH684ZLCahhPzS2i2gQOg53lJz.gif) (but doesn&#39;t have to be animated)</li><li>Newest Legacy winking like ![](upload://AqwN1eaB2ijblayeQehpt1PQoo3.gif) (but doesn&#39;t have to be animated)</li><li>Guise with a jaw drop like ![](upload://mObJK1cHlNcwMXH9ldjhlymlhgH.gif) (but doesn&#39;t have to be animated)</li><li>Unity with hearts like ![](upload://v8HPFTp4mIGfU9rdG54voZZlPnh.gif)</li><li>Wraith with an eyebrow like ![](upload://9qKzo7rdh2SEmje4yySNDJ2ICps.gif) (but doesn&#39;t have to be animated)</li><li>Baron Blade pissed like&nbsp;![](upload://rz5Q0N0ReCDlc9KAXM0Hfpv6BLm.gif) or ![](upload://3qgcmiEaVJZfKJ6FzVpht64SF0U.gif) (but doesn&#39;t have to be animated)</li><li>Scholar sleeping like ![](upload://nYlva6ugx8FENL6V4kPf5qQmkb8.gif) (but doesn&#39;t have to be animated)</li><li>Unity, Idealist, and/or Setback waving like ![](upload://vXJR8ArJQF3gqkH55rqU6hwNVdU.gif)</li><li>Tachyon eating pizza?</li><li>Guise wistling innocently like ![](upload://l1MMla63MCJlCewIYsaArh2tOMW.gif) (but doesn&#39;t have to be animated)</li><li>Setback excited like ![](upload://yifLHqu7Iy8YiYhUibk8ZT40yv8.gif)</li><li>Voss, Dawn, and/or Baron Blade with an evil laugh like ![](upload://qZmrCcyqf6JEhlM9KvvswlEzBCs.gif)</li><li>Baron Blade, Dawn, and/or Voss plotting like ![](upload://lqu7dvkxWWTR5yKPjVocbpW3Vk1.gif)</li><li>Ambuscade banging his head against a wall like ![](upload://wn6iM78tKMWMnj2lNHF749jljz0.gif)</li><li>Absolute Zero (just AZ -- cuz that covers all his emotions ![](upload://nchIGjrCD2ydeKFOxqHOVH9DOiO.gif))</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If someone is good with creating emoji and has the time/interest, I am willing to host them (until some time when we can work with GTG to get them officially hosted). They&#39;ll be more annoying to use than just clicking, as you have to insert an image (like I do now), but at least they&#39;ll be available.</p><p>What ideas do you all think would be fun / entertaining? (And feel free to dismiss any of the above -- I was just brainstorming.)</p>",
